      "original_domain": "Real x, x != -1",
      "proof": [
        "With u=x-2: u^3+27=(u+3)(u^2-3u+9).",
        "u+3=x+1 and u^2-3u+9=(x-2)^2-3(x-2)+9=x^2-7x+19.",
